  m_Name: firstPlantTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialStep
  stepId: firstPlantTutorial
  title: Planting Trees
  body: When you plant a tree it goes through a few stages until it reaches maturity.
    You need to water and fertilize it, because otherwise it receives a health penalty.
    Mature trees receive a lesser penalty.\n When your tree reaches the mature stage
    it will automatically start planting too!\n You can also use the Remove tool
    on your seed to remove it and add it to your seeds count.
  image: {fileID: 0}
